ZcM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPouuahpOiKb4xVwAiSRof1u-qHs1KCA9CLaQhXX7qd2A&oe=6AE4A07E"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "950220984178480", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_950220987511813_6312653769358299262_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zELdQelX_TEQ7kNvwGMTl9P&_nc_oc=AdrvX_n60trVjz27c8M9MueyIsFNk4K_neb28eFLxsPjLnFbvNZ2gi1PjYN2ZE8u5js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtCnqjJdyR6OKNb6XAcFNs2Xavn7DzfghiW4vORqtrRA&oe=6AE4ADD7"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "936221049350489", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308045_936221052683822_2393134125121488634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jZYgy-m0wvQQ7kNvwG8DYCU&_nc_oc=Adpkct1xPBFvOxGw2kiIoKL1MENyStCroyReOdS-HvTsXAMjL4IdoYT3wMamK1WszVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMMtg7bCPDxOAj9s1vNnVYOfXp6cItx0UftevIW1npvMg&oe=6AE4BB86"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1289311403206923", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1289311406540256_8222422092377036341_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zMyLw4s4oN4Q7kNvwE5Jaht&_nc_oc=Adp5Z5rJ9yx9DLnNhv98-ZUyDd_XiFtCIFpGDrQ0ENPLRY05XkqNEkUTIHpjyfhBRv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMZXg7vFftf-xDURb6uQskN5XHpzC2DQCjtFJsxxE7wEQ&oe=6AE4978E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "QR Scanner VR", "keywords": ["QRcode", "scanner", "mixedreality", "barcode", "passthrough"], "long_description": " QR Scanner VR is the fastest way to scan QR codes without taking off your headset.\n\n  Point the reticle, pull the trigger \u2014 the app recognizes the code and gives you a one-tap action tailored to its type.\n\n  WHAT IT DOES\n\n  \ud83d\udd17 URLs \u2014 open in the browser (YouTube links route to YouTube VR)\n\n  \ud83d\udcf6 Wi-Fi \u2014 auto-connects, no password typing\n\n  \ud83d\udc64 vCard \u2014 saves to contacts\n  \ud83d\udce7 Email / \ud83d\udcde Phone / \ud83d\udcac SMS \u2014 opens the right app pre-filled\n\n  \ud83d\udccd Geo \u2014 opens in Google Maps\n\n  \ud83d\udcc5 Calendar events \u2014 adds to your calendar\n\n  \ud83d\udccb Plain text \u2014 copies to clipboard\n\n  CONTROLS\n  \u2022 Right trigger \u2014 scan / click\n\n  \u2022 A copy \u00b7 B open \u00b7 X pause \u00b7 Y clear\n\n  \u2022 Stick up/down \u2014 zoom panel + scan area (zoom in for tiny codes)\n\n  \u2022 Stick left/right \u2014 history navigation\n\n\n  FEATURES\n\n  \u2713 Persistent history (up to 100 codes)\n\n  \u2713 CSV export to Downloads\n\n  \u2713 Audio beep + haptic feedback\n\n  \u2713 Optimized for small or distant codes\n\n  \u2713 Native VR with passthrough\n\n\n  FIRST LAUNCH\n  Enable ALL camera permissions (Camera AND Headset Camera).\n\n If scanning isn't working: Settings \u2192 Apps \u2192 QR Scanner VR \u2192 Permissions.\n\n  Compatible with Meta Quest 3 and Quest 3S.\n\n  \u2554\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2557\n\n    \ud83d\udcac \ud835\udde6\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01, \ud835\uddf3\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude01\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfe\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf2\ud835\ude00\ud835\ude01\ud835\ude00, \ud835\uddef\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf4 \ud835\uddff\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01\ud835\ude00:\n    https://discord.gg/5gUHResGZU\n\n  \u255a\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u255d", "short_description": "Scan QR codes in mixed reality using your Quest 3 passthrough camer